OL,3,GNEWSADad thanks DIY SOS team as son's
OL,4,A'miracle' homecoming shown
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe father of a teenager whose
OL,7,F"miracle" return home was made possible
OL,8,Fby the BBC's DIY SOS has said the
OL,9,Fexperience was "humbling" and a
OL,10,Freminder that "there are a lot of good
OL,11,Fpeople out there".
OL,13,FSixteen-year-old Dan, from Freckleton,
OL,14,FLancashire, had been living in hospital
OL,15,Fin Manchester after a life-saving
OL,16,Foperation to remove a brain tumour left
OL,17,Fhim with complex disabilities.
OL,19,FDan needs non-invasive ventilation at
OL,20,Fnights. But his family home needed
OL,21,Fmajor adaptations for him to receive
OL,22,Fthe ventilation there.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
