OL,3,GNEWSADad thanks DIY SOS team as son's
OL,4,A'miracle' homecoming shown
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis father, Nigel, told BBC Radio
OL,7,FLancashire: "When your life is turned
OL,8,Fupside down you have to learn to live
OL,9,Fagain."
